# CR 733.1: "Players may not reverse actions that ... moved cards from a library to any zone other than the stack", with
# the owner's ruling that an undo never reveals information. Bolas's Citadel casts Bone Splinters off the top of the
# library for 1 life, and Ashiok, Wicked Manipulator exiles the next card, Lightning Bolt, in place of that life (CR 119.4,
# 614.1a). Since the exile could change what the sacrifice chooses among, the order of the payment's steps is asked (CR
# 601.2h), and the life is paid first. That step of the payment may not be reversed and the rest of the cast can't be undone from under it, so from
# then on the cast is past taking back: at the question of which creature to sacrifice, no cancel is offered. The player
# completes the cast, Bone Splinters destroys its target, and the Bolt stays in exile with the life still 20.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
